                <popup x="-113" y="288" width="367" height="187" background="yellow" color="black">
                    <text_box font-family="Arial" font-size="16">Here&apos;s a very simple version of the Stock and Flow model used in Lesson 5. &quot;Weekly Income $&quot; effect the rate that $$ flow into MY ACCOUNT; &quot;Weekly Expense $&quot; effect the rate that $$ flow out. &#x0D;&#x0D;Explore (e.g., change amounts ($) for deposits or expenses; rename or add new building blocks to make this &quot;your&quot; model). Play with it and have fun!&#x0D;</text_box>
