            <button x="349" y="1203" width="129" height="34" uid="43" appearance="opaque" background="#0CA0FF" color="white" style="rounded" label="What can I do with this?" font-family="Arial" font-size="12" text-align="center">
                <popup x="-127" y="283" width="422" height="222" background="yellow" color="black">
                    <text_box font-family="Arial" font-size="16">This is a version of the model underlying the Lesson 5 Simulation. When you click and open any building block, you will find an explanation for how it works. &#x0D;&#x0D;Notice that we&apos;ve changed how &quot;Income $&quot; enter MY ACCOUNT. And we&apos;ve added 3 additional &quot;TOTAL&quot; STOCKS. Can you figure out why we made these changes?  Click on these building blocks to learn more. &#x0D; &#x0D;Explore ow you can make changes (e.g., change numbers; rename or add new building blocks to make this &quot;your&quot; model). Play with it and have fun!&#x0D;</text_box>
                </popup>
